{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:BraidsAndKnots.BraidActionTensor","@type":"LeanModule","name":"BraidsAndKnots.BraidActionTensor","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Category","lean:module:Mathlib.CategoryTheory.Monoidal.Braided.Basic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.braid_action_tensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.braid_action_tensor","kind":"def","line":229,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L229-L237","doc":"Every braided monoidal category yields a B₃ representation on V⊗³. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:braid-action-tensor","label":"prop:braid-action-tensor","md":"quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.braid_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.braid_rel","kind":"theorem","line":227,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L227-L227","doc":"The braid relation holds. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.gen2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.gen2","kind":"def","line":225,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L225-L225","doc":"Generator σ₂ = id_V ⊗ c_{V,V} (via associator). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.gen1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.gen1","kind":"def","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L223-L223","doc":"Generator σ₁ = c_{V,V} ⊗ id_V. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.V","kind":"def","line":221,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L221-L221","doc":"The fundamental object. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3.mk","kind":"ctor","line":218,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L218-L218","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidRepB3","kind":"structure","line":215,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L215-L227","doc":"**B₃ representation data**: the two generators σ₁, σ₂ and\nthe proof that they satisfy the braid relation, constituting\na group homomorphism ρ₃ : B₃ → Aut_C((V ⊗ V) ⊗ V). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.yang_baxter_braiding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.yang_baxter_braiding","kind":"theorem","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L166-L211","doc":"**The Yang–Baxter equation / braid relation** for the categorical braiding.\n\n**Theorem** (Kassel, Theorem XIII.1.3).\nσ₁σ₂σ₁ = σ₂σ₁σ₂ as endomorphisms of (V ⊗ V) ⊗ V.\n\nThis is the central result connecting B₃ to braided monoidal categories:\nit shows that ρ₃ : B₃ → Aut_C(V^⊗3) is a well-defined group homomorphism.\n\n**Proof** (diagram chase using three lemmas):\n1. `sigma12_eq_alpha_braiding`: σ₁ ≫ σ₂ = α ≫ β_{V,V⊗V}  (hexagon)\n2. `braiding_nat_sigma`: β_{V,V⊗V} ≫ σ₁ = (V◁β) ≫ β_{V,V⊗V}  (naturality)\n3. `sigma2_alpha_interchange`: σ₂ ≫ α = α ≫ (V◁β)  (definition) ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.sigma2_is_iso","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.sigma2_is_iso","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L84-L101","doc":"σ₂ is an isomorphism: σ₂ ≫ σ₂⁻¹ = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.sigma1_is_iso","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.sigma1_is_iso","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L78-L82","doc":"σ₁ is an isomorphism: σ₁ ≫ σ₁⁻¹ = id. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.sigma2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.sigma2","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L70-L76","doc":"σ₂ acting on (V ⊗ V) ⊗ V: applies the braiding to the last\ntwo tensor factors, transported through the associator.\nThis is ρ₃(σ₂) = id_V ⊗ c_{V,V} (in strict form). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.sigma1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.sigma1","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L63-L68","doc":"σ₁ acting on (V ⊗ V) ⊗ V: applies the braiding to the first\ntwo tensor factors. This is ρ₃(σ₁) = c_{V,V} ⊗ id_V. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.braiding_inv_hom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.braiding_inv_hom","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L54-L59","doc":"The inverse braiding composes correctly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.braiding_is_iso","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.braiding_is_iso","kind":"theorem","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L47-L52","doc":"The braiding is an isomorphism (invertible). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.braiding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.braiding","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The braiding c_{V,V} : V ⊗ V → V ⊗ V. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.strands_ge_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.strands_ge_two","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.numStrands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.numStrands","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L40-L40","doc":"Number of strands n ≥ 2. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.V","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.V","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The object V to be tensored. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor.mk","kind":"ctor","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Braiding.BraidActionTensor","kind":"structure","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/braids-and-knots/braid-action-tensor.lean#L30-L43","doc":"**Braid representation on V^⊗n** in a braided monoidal category.\n\nEach Artin generator σ_i acts by applying the braiding c_{V,V}\nat positions i, i+1 and identity elsewhere. ","signatureChunk":0}]}